PFC Trends — thirty days of day ratings with a 7-day rolling-mean line, plus
7-day tiles (avg rating, avg sleep, exercise days, rolling sleep debt) and an
exercise-gap line. The rolling mean is the trendline: seven points is a week,
thirty with a smoothed line is a direction. Retrospective only — actions and
fixes live on pfc-pulse, never here.

Chart rules (e-ink): ALL animation disabled (chart, plotOptions.series, and
per-series) — the screenshot captures one frame and an animating chart renders
blank. Columns mid-gray (#999), mean line solid black, markers off — black on
black is unreadable at 4-bit. Missing days are null, never 0. Transparent
background, no legend, no tooltips.
{%- endcomment -%}
